1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,300
Caregiving also means comparing
appointment letters,

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,600
medicine lists, dates, and bills.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,400
In Singapore, primary informal
caregivers provide an average

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,700
of 33 care hours each week.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,800
KithRelay turns fragmented paperwork
into one source-linked care handoff

6
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:21,600
a family can verify.

7
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,700
Seven synthetic documents become
one current timeline:

8
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:29,200
the latest appointment,
medication changes,

9
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,600
a payment deadline,
and every supporting source.

10
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:37,400
Every important change links
to its exact source file,

11
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:43,600
while approval remains locked until
the caregiver reviews the evidence.

12
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,800
KithRelay and WorkBuddy share
one authorized folder.

13
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:51,800
The website remembers access
where supported,

14
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:55,600
copies the task,
and opens the desktop agent.

15
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:00,200
The installed skill gives WorkBuddy
the workflow and safety boundaries.

16
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:05,200
It inventories the folder,
reconciles dates and medicines,

17
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:11,600
verifies traceability,
and writes two drafts.

18
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,600
When the files appear,
KithRelay detects

19
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:19,800
the newest calendar and briefing
automatically,

20
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:23,600
then brings them back
into the review workspace.

21
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:28,500
The caregiver verifies important details
before approval,

22
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:34,600
then exports the calendar, briefing,
or source-linked evidence bundle.

23
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:38,600
The outcome is not automated care.

24
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:42,600
It is a better-prepared family
with less context lost.

25
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:46,400
KithRelay. Every care detail,

26
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:49,600
carried forward—with its source.
